                    sling:resourceType="core/franklin/components/block/v1/block"
                    aueComponentId="richtext"
                    ctaText="View Open Roles"
                    ctaUrl="/content/my-dxp-site/contact"
                    heading="From Enterprise IT to AI-First Experiences"
                    lead="We didn't set out to build another CMS. We set out to solve the most important challenge facing every organization: how to deliver experiences that actually matter to people, at scale."
                    model="richtext-block"
                    modelFields="[overline@text,heading@text,lead@text,text@richtext,sidebarTitle@text,sidebarText@richtext,ctaUrl@aem-content,ctaText@text]"
                    name="Richtext"
                    overline="Our Story"
                    sidebarText="&lt;p>We're building the future of AI-powered digital experiences. Come work on hard problems with a world-class team.&lt;/p>"
                    sidebarTitle="Join Our Team"
                    text="&lt;p>Zensar Technologies has been at the forefront of enterprise digital transformation since 1991. Over three decades, we've worked with Fortune 500 companies, global banks, healthcare systems, and government bodies — helping them navigate each wave of digital change.&lt;/p>&lt;p>When AI began reshaping every industry, we recognized a gap: existing digital experience platforms weren't built for the intelligence era. They were built for the web era — static, expensive to deploy, and bolted-on AI at best.&lt;/p>&lt;h3>The ZensAI Vision&lt;/h3>&lt;p>In 2022, Zensar established ZensAI as a dedicated AI innovation lab with a single mission: build the world's first truly AI-native Digital Experience Platform. Not a CMS with AI features sprinkled on top — but a platform where intelligence is the foundation, not an afterthought.&lt;/p>&lt;p>DXP AI launched in 2024, and in its first year it has been adopted by 500+ enterprise organizations across banking, retail, healthcare, manufacturing, and government sectors globally.&lt;/p>&lt;h3>About Zensar Technologies&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Zensar Technologies Ltd. (NSE: ZENSARTECH) is a leading digital solutions and technology services company, part of the RPG Group. Headquartered in Pune, India, Zensar has 10,000+ professionals across 30+ global offices and serves 200+ clients in 30+ countries.&lt;/p>"/>
            </section_2>
